# A project API key for a DEDICATED Hookdeck Event Gateway test project.
# Project settings -> API keys -> API key. The demo calls `hookdeck ci --api-key`
# with this, so it never touches whatever project you are logged into interactively.
HOOKDECK_API_KEY=

# Shared secret configured on the GITHUB source. send-webhook.ts signs payloads
# with it (X-Hub-Signature-256) so source verification runs exactly as in production.
# Use any random string, e.g. `openssl rand -hex 20`.
GITHUB_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Optional. Defaults to https://api.hookdeck.com/2026-09-01
# HOOKDECK_API_BASE=https://api.hookdeck.com/2026-09-01
